' SD-05. UC-005 전방·좌측·우측 방향이 모두 막힌 경우 후진 - 우측 센서 제거 버전
' Related Use Case: UC-005. 전방·좌측·우측 방향이 모두 막힌 경우 후진
' Intent: 전방, 좌측, 기존 우측 방향이 모두 막힌 상태에서 후방 장애물 여부를 확인하고 후진 또는 정지로 분기하는 흐름을 표현한다.
' Note: 기존 우측 방향은 우측 센서가 아니라 UC-003의 우측 90도 회전 탐색 또는 후진 후 탐색으로 확인한다.

@startuml SD_05_UC005_Backward_On_Three_Side_Obstacle_Without_Right_Sensor
hide footbox
title SD-05 - UC-005 전방·좌측·우측 방향이 모두 막힌 경우 후진 - 우측 센서 제거

actor "센서 입력" as Sensor
participant "RVC SW Controller" as Controller
participant "SensorState" as SensorState
participant "AutomaticCleaning" as Cleaning
participant "RightDirectionProbe" as RightProbe
participant "MovementCommand" as MovementCommand
participant "AvoidanceDecision" as AvoidanceDecision
actor "주행 장치" as Drive

alt 후진 가능
    note right of Controller: UC-003에서 전방, 좌측, 기존 우측 방향이 모두 막힘으로 확인됨
    Sensor -> Controller: reportBackObstacleState(backObstacleDetected=false)
    activate Controller
    Controller -> SensorState: updateBackObstacle(backObstacleDetected=false)
    Controller -> Cleaning: handleThreeSideObstacle(SensorState)
    activate Cleaning
    note right of Cleaning: UC-003에서 전방, 좌측, 기존 우측 방향이\n모두 막힌 것으로 확인된 상태를 처리한다.
    Cleaning -> Cleaning: changeMovementStatus(BLOCKED)
    Cleaning -> MovementCommand: create(STOP)
    MovementCommand --> Cleaning: stopCommand
    Cleaning --> Controller: commandResult(stopCommand)
    Controller -> Drive: stop()
    Cleaning -> SensorState: canMoveBackward()
    SensorState --> Cleaning: true
    Cleaning -> MovementCommand: create(MOVE_BACKWARD)
    MovementCommand --> Cleaning: backwardCommand
    Cleaning --> Controller: commandResult(backwardCommand)
    deactivate Cleaning
    Controller -> Drive: moveBackward()
    Drive --> Controller: backwardCompleted()

    Sensor -> Controller: reportLeftObstacleState(leftObstacleDetected)
    Controller -> SensorState: updateLeftObstacle(leftObstacleDetected)
    Controller -> Cleaning: selectAvoidanceDirection(SensorState)
    activate Cleaning

    alt 후진 후 좌측 이동 가능
        Cleaning -> AvoidanceDecision: select(LEFT)
        AvoidanceDecision --> Cleaning: selectedDirection=LEFT
        Cleaning -> MovementCommand: create(TURN_LEFT)
        MovementCommand --> Cleaning: turnLeftCommand
        Cleaning --> Controller: commandResult(turnLeftCommand)
        Controller -> Drive: turnLeft()
        note right of Cleaning: UC-004로 전환
    else 후진 후 좌측 막힘으로 우측 탐색 필요
        Cleaning -> RightProbe: active=true
        Cleaning -> RightProbe: result=UNKNOWN
        Cleaning -> RightProbe: restoreOriginalHeadingRequired=false
        Cleaning -> MovementCommand: create(TURN_RIGHT)
        MovementCommand --> Cleaning: turnRightForProbeCommand
        Cleaning --> Controller: commandResult(turnRightForProbeCommand)
        deactivate Cleaning
        Controller -> Drive: turnRight()

        Sensor -> Controller: reportFrontObstacleState(frontObstacleDetected)
        Controller -> SensorState: updateFrontObstacle(frontObstacleDetected)
        Controller -> Cleaning: selectAvoidanceDirection(SensorState)
        activate Cleaning
        Cleaning -> RightProbe: active?
        RightProbe --> Cleaning: true
        Cleaning -> SensorState: isFrontObstacleDetected()
        SensorState --> Cleaning: frontObstacleDetected
        note right of Cleaning: 우측 탐색 회전 후 전방 센서값으로\n기존 우측 방향의 개방 여부를 판단한다.

        alt 후진 후 기존 우측 방향 이동 가능
            Cleaning -> RightProbe: result=OPEN
            Cleaning -> RightProbe: active=false
            Cleaning -> AvoidanceDecision: select(RIGHT)
            AvoidanceDecision --> Cleaning: selectedDirection=RIGHT
            Cleaning --> Controller: avoidanceDecision(selectedDirection=RIGHT)
            note right of Controller: 우측 탐색 회전 자세를 유지한 채 UC-004로 전환
        else 후진 후 기존 우측 방향 막힘
            Cleaning -> RightProbe: result=BLOCKED
            Cleaning -> RightProbe: restoreOriginalHeadingRequired=true
            Cleaning -> MovementCommand: create(TURN_LEFT)
            MovementCommand --> Cleaning: returnToOriginalHeadingCommand
            Cleaning --> Controller: commandResult(returnToOriginalHeadingCommand)
            Controller -> Drive: turnLeft()
            Cleaning -> RightProbe: active=false
            Cleaning -> AvoidanceDecision: markBackwardRequired()
            AvoidanceDecision --> Cleaning: backwardRequired=true
            Cleaning -> Cleaning: changeMovementStatus(BLOCKED)
            Cleaning --> Controller: stillBlocked()
            note right of Cleaning: 정지 상태 유지 또는 추가 후진 판단
        end
    end
else 후진 불가 또는 후방 상태 불명
    note right of Controller: UC-003에서 전방, 좌측, 기존 우측 방향이 모두 막힘으로 확인됨
    Sensor -> Controller: reportBackObstacleState(backObstacleDetected=true or UNKNOWN)
    activate Controller
    Controller -> SensorState: updateBackObstacle(backObstacleDetected=true or UNKNOWN)
    Controller -> Cleaning: handleThreeSideObstacle(SensorState)
    activate Cleaning
    note right of Cleaning: UC-003에서 전방, 좌측, 기존 우측 방향이\n모두 막힌 것으로 확인된 상태를 처리한다.
    Cleaning -> SensorState: canMoveBackward()
    SensorState --> Cleaning: false
    Cleaning -> MovementCommand: create(STOP)
    MovementCommand --> Cleaning: stopCommand
    Cleaning -> Cleaning: changeMovementStatus(STOPPED)
    Cleaning --> Controller: commandResult(stopCommand)
    Controller -> Drive: stop()
end

Cleaning --> Controller: threeSideObstacleHandled()
deactivate Cleaning
deactivate Controller
@enduml
